        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "body": "={\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"max_tokens\":1024,\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Score this job for the following candidate. Return only JSON with fields: score (1-10), reason, matching_skills, skill_gaps, tailoring_angle.\\n\\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\\n- AWS Certified Solutions Architect\\n- 4+ years experience in DevOps, Cloud Engineering, DevSecOps\\n- Currently Cloud Engineer at Whitbread PLC Manchester (2023-present)\\n- Previously DevSecOps Engineer at Egen India (2020-2022)\\n- MSc Advanced Computer Science, University of Kent\\n- Skills: AWS, Azure, Kubernetes, Docker, Helm, Terraform, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Azure DevOps, Python, Bash, Java, Spring Boot, Prometheus, Grafana, ArgoCD, Snyk, SonarQube\\n- Achieved 99.95% uptime, cut MTTR from 45 to 25 minutes, reduced deployment effort by 45%\\n- Based in Manchester UK, open to hybrid or remote ANYWHERE in UK, willing to travel\\n\\nJOB TO SCORE:\\nTitle: {{ $json.job_title.replace(/\\\"/g, '') }}\\nLocation: {{ $json.location || 'Not specified' }}\\nSalary: {{ $json.salary_range || 'Not specified' }}\\nDescription: {{ ($json.job_description || '').replace(/[\\n\\r\\\"]/g, ' ').substring(0, 800) }}\"}]}",
        "options": {}
      },
